Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the Minister can really cause miracles with his Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then why did it turn out like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please cease fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please cease fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send out the Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please cease fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give us the Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose, is it okay that\Nwe're not fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:50.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Against whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:59.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans are foolish beyond saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foolish! Foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With things going this well, \Nsuch foolishness is refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't\Nthe almighty Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I did was incite the\Nmembers of the order,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the believers\Nbegan killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the military is just adding fuel to\Nthe fire by trying to quell the disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:25.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times they repeat themselves,\Nthey never know enough to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans are foolish,\Nmiserable creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of this to create\Na Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, I can finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:43.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,return to this adorable form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You enjoy making yourself up as young, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten\Nwhat I originally looked like, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Minister...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you done with the real Minister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just tell him the truth? The Minister has long since—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:05.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:22.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:38.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got some information saying \Nthat guy is headed from Central to East.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean the State Alchemist killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Flame Colonel is in East City, along with...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By now, the Fullmetal pipsqueak is making his stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:36.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that boy is the closest one\Nto our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't have that guy\Njust going around on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust, that was delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wipe your mouth, Gluttony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right...\NSo, what was this guy named?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Scar"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:58.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scarred man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know his\Nreal identity, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got eyewitness testimony saying he has a large scar on his forehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so that's what we call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he's the one who killed a number of State Alchemists in Central?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nine of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four just in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you count the whole country,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:21.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nine State Alchemists\Nhave fallen by his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:25.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you include other\Npersonnel around them,\Nit's well into the dozens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:29.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judging from the wounds, it looks like\Nthey blew up from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As far as his weapons and his objectives go,\Nwe don't know a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, the folks at the Central Command Center panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They made the excuse that\Nthey were escorting the Führer\Nand went on this trip {\i1}en masse{\i0}, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the killer won't come to this backwoods place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're here, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who demoted you\Nthree years ago are aware...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,of your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm beginning to\Nwant to run away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The issue is who\Nhis next target will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:02.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, but I have a cute little daughter who's about to turn three—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Telephone for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello, this is Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body of one of the soldiers patrolling East City Station has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blown up from the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor Marcoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Mauro-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}Marcoh{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's only one doctor in this village, \Nand that's Mauro-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the folks along this road are poor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and we had to take half a day \Njust to get to East City to see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a nice fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll make sure to see even patients who were given up on as incurable elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I got my leg caught under a tractor and it looked like I was going to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he fixed me up just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When he was treating him, right? There was this flash of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Light...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:17.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's alchemy all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Doctor Marcoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he's on the run\Nfrom the military, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would he become a doctor? There'd be stories about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm getting straw inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:40.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a State Alchemist—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,one of those who was with the Führer when they came from Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.55,0:07:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did he follow us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Colonel said he never reported Marcoh's whereabouts to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.27,0:07:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marcoh's house should be close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on! We just wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A State Alchemist, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you come to take me back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, you're the Crystal Alchemist, Doctor Marcoh-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! I couldn't stand that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like that! Hear us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, that's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or have you come to silence me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think you can kill me? I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.05,0:08:36.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you kill me, I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:57.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see, you're the Fullmetal Alchemist...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No, that would be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm him, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I deserted the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and when I did, I stole the research materials that I had at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military is probably\Nstill after those materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:29.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is, we're looking into human transmutation—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,show you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Orders from above notwithstanding,\NI stained my hands with that research.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, it was used in the\Nmassacre of the Eastern Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Massacre?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean the uprising at Ishbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:57.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was terrible.\NIt was a truly terrible battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:01.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Children... women...\NThey were all killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was no justifiable reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was reason enough that they were the people of Ishbal and defied the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:13.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could never fully make up for what \NI did there even if I gave up my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I decided to do all that I can, which is why I am a doctor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a right to see your research!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As little as you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you were blinded by\Nthe abundant research funding
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and numerous privileges, \Nso you got yourself certified.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were there during\Nthe rebellion, you would also—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know what we're doing is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:46.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marcoh-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About five years ago, you treated \Nthe babies at Xenotime, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:00.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The babies from that time are now doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No transmutation circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this the red water of Xenotime?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, this appears to be much clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, this is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!\NBrother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:29.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a liquid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like that thing that the Minister at Liore had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Sage's Stone, the Celestial Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Great Elixir, the Red Tincture, the Fifth Element...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:59.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as it is called by many names,\Nits form is also not limited to that of a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brigadier General Grand...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brigadier General?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, you've moved up in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crystal Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you will turn over the Philosopher's Stone, along with all of your materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Philosopher's Stone?! That?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At best, it is an experimentally produced item.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no telling when it will\Nreach its limit and become unusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:29.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an unstable, defective product,\Nand it's different from the genuine article.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But during the rebellion,\Nit did augment our abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and we displayed tremendous power!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:54.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, are you saying\Nthat in the past,\Nthe military researched\Nthe Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that it isn't perfect.\NIf that was made by human hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it means that it's possible to\Ncreate a Philosopher's Stone as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is the manufacturing technique?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean to do\Nonce you see it, Fullmetal Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The research is top secret\Nand falls under my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:16.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot permit you\Nto see the materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:28.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of it!\NPlease forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!\NI can't stand anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just like that other time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may not have grown at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't let my heart stay stunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iron Blood Alchemist, Basque Grand...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I now have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the guy I saw three years ago\Nin Central. I'm sure of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never mind that! This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:02.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My instincts are telling me to run,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but my legs won't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crystal Alchemist, Doctor Marcoh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must take special care...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. This must be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the name of God, \Nthou shalt perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you giving up for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will not escape either!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He knows me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've done plenty of stuff \Nto get people mad at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I've never given anyone\Na reason to come after my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you after us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you are creators, then there must also be a destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:47.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun, leave me behind and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a fine look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:17:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My older brother also had the same look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eyes that were strong, that peered far away\Ninto the endless distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:12.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was glad to hear that you had\Ngiven up being a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I meant to destroy a human body,\Nso you got away with just that crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My only enemy is the State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemists are those who take things \Nfrom their natural form
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and transform them into something grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is to say, they profane God, the creator of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As an agent of God,\NI am he who hands down his judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an alchemist too!\NI may not have the state's certification...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you wish to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mentioned your older brother a moment ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:26.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you should understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone could watch their brother get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even you—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way I felt when I had to watch as \Nmy brother was killed before my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why I must now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, you're too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Automail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So your right arm brings forth\Nnothing but destruction as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go lumping my \Nright arm in with yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you here to take Marcoh-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was assigned by the Lt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel to guard you.\NBy Lt. Colonel Hughes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Agent of God, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, try passing judgment upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For I am the Strong Arm Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:56.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alex Louis Armstrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:01.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a fine day this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That you would come forward\Nand save me the trouble of finding you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could this be the grace of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you\Nthe artistic alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that has been passed down among\Nthe Armstrong family for generations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see,\Nthere are only children here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't any of the guerillas you're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does this mean you've abandoned\Nthe so-called teachings of Cornello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell us the location of the faction that's resisting military rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We came to liberate this town from Cornello!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This town is our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:21:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to move forward,\Neven if it's only a little at a time, under our own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our legs are fine, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't think about\Nrunning away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You used it to treat people in that clinic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't forget the looks on the faces of \Nthose people who told us about you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That belongs to those people, and so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:52.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someplace where neither that guy nor the military will follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we escape them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still have your legs, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.67,0:23:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 15: "The Ishbal Massacre"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.63,0:23:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you can't use ignorance as an excuse to absolve yourself.
